===Levels 82–99: Minnows===
{{Main|Minnow}}
[[File:Fishing Guild minnow platform.png|right|250px]]
Catching [[minnow]]s offers relatively slow experience, but it can provide decent profit depending on the Grand Exchange price of [[raw shark]]s. This can be done at [[Kylie Minnow]]'s fishing platform in the [[Fishing Guild]], which requires level 82 Fishing, a [[small fishing net]], completion of the quest [[Fishing Contest]], and having full [[angler's outfit]] to access. Minnows can be exchanged for noted [[raw shark]]s, which can be sold for profit.

Minnow fishing spots move clockwise every 15 seconds. In addition, a fishing spot will occasionally spawn flying fish instead of providing minnows; flying fish will eat 20 minnow directly from the player's inventory as long as they keep fishing there, forcing them to move to another spot. A flying fish will only appear after a fishing spot has changed and will continue to eat the player's minnows until the fishing spot changes position once again. 

